cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{-1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888c0b2ae15149f23f3ea5c4491b24ffba985fae3980"} {"question" "q-142026" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6980450903c1aa78562080ae506961f662f89a759004cadf4351f0ee99276815"} {"question" "q-142026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888c0b2ae15149f23f3ea5c4491b24ffba985fae3980"} {"question" "q-142026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}"] ["math" "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888c0b2ae15149f23f3ea5c4491b24ffba985fae3980"} {"question" "q-142026" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888c0b2ae15149f23f3ea5c4491b24ffba985fae3980"} {"question" "q-274570" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Express $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{270}^{∘})$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ or $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{270}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888c0b2ae15149f23f3ea5c4491b24ffba985fae3980"} {"question" "q-274570" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={270}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{270}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{270}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{270}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (0)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888c0b2ae15149f23f3ea5c4491b24ffba985fae3980"} {"question" "q-274570" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6980450903c1aa78562080ae506961f662f89a759004cadf4351f0ee99276815"} {"question" "q-274570" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979886/state.json" "file_sha256" "b1636787db7fdb01bff7888